{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"王阳明·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"wang-yangming","categoryLabel":"王阳明","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/24_wang-yangming/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"王阳明-核心贡献\">王阳明·核心贡献</h1><p>王阳明对中国思想最具突破性的贡献，是集心学之大成、开创了一个足以与程朱理学相抗衡的伟大思想传统。本部分围绕三大核心命题系统展开：<strong>心即理</strong>（1508 龙场悟道，确立道德的内在根源）、<strong>知行合一</strong>（约 1509，纠正知行脱节之弊）、<strong>致良知</strong>（约 1521，晚年揭出的成圣根本心法），揭示他作为心学集大成者的崇高地位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>王阳明全集共六个 hub，本 hub 聚焦&quot;<strong>贡献是什么、为何重要、彼此如何构成体系</strong>&quot;，而把生平、文本、流变交给兄弟 hub，刻意不重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他经历了什么</td>\n<td>提供命题诞生的史实背景（龙场、平叛）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核心贡献</strong>（本 hub）</td>\n<td>三大命题及其体系地位</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>学理细部与修养方法</td>\n<td>本 hub 给&quot;贡献定位&quot;，它给&quot;学理纵深&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n<td>思想载于何处</td>\n<td>《传习录》《大学问》四句教是命题的文本依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>后世如何承传</td>\n<td>本 hub 命题的下游效应（学派、东亚、当代）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>命题受何质疑</td>\n<td>本 hub 各篇&quot;权衡/反模式&quot;的展开</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：本 hub 是&quot;贡献的骨架&quot;，思想与方法是&quot;血肉&quot;，争议与评价是&quot;体检报告&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[心即理] --&gt; B[心学的集大成]&#10;    A --&gt; C[知行合一]&#10;    C --&gt; D[反对空谈之学]&#10;    C --&gt; E[致良知]&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[圣门的正法眼藏]\">flowchart LR\n    A[心即理] --&gt; B[心学的集大成]\n    A --&gt; C[知行合一]\n    C --&gt; D[反对空谈之学]\n    C --&gt; E[致良知]\n    A --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[圣门的正法眼藏]</pre><ol>\n<li>先读 <a href=\"the-school-of-mind/mind-is-principle\">心即理</a>——一切的逻辑起点；</li>\n<li>再读 <a href=\"the-school-of-mind/completing-neo-confucianism\">心学的集大成</a>，了解三命题如何构成体系；</li>\n<li>进入 <a href=\"unity-of-knowing-and-acting/the-doctrine\">知行合一</a> 及其落实 <a href=\"unity-of-knowing-and-acting/against-empty-learning\">反对空谈之学</a>；</li>\n<li>最后读 <a href=\"innate-knowledge/extending-liangzhi\">致良知</a> 与 <a href=\"innate-knowledge/the-final-teaching\">圣门的正法眼藏</a>，理解晚年最高概括。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：略知宋明理学与程朱&quot;性即理&quot;&quot;格物穷理&quot;框架会更顺；若陌生，可先看 <a href=\"the-school-of-mind/completing-neo-confucianism\">心学的集大成</a> 的&quot;宋明理学两条路线&quot;一节。命题背后的生平，建议对照 <a href=\"../life-and-times/exile-and-enlightenment/enlightenment-at-longchang\">龙场悟道</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-school-of-mind","title":"The School Of Mind","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/the-school-of-mind","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mind-is-principle","title":"心即理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/the-school-of-mind/mind-is-principle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"completing-neo-confucianism","title":"心学的集大成","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/the-school-of-mind/completing-neo-confucianism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"unity-of-knowing-and-acting","title":"Unity Of Knowing And Acting","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/unity-of-knowing-and-acting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-doctrine","title":"知行合一","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/unity-of-knowing-and-acting/the-doctrine"},{"seq":2,"slug":"against-empty-learning","title":"反对空谈之学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/unity-of-knowing-and-acting/against-empty-learning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"innate-knowledge","title":"Innate Knowledge","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/innate-knowledge","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"extending-liangzhi","title":"致良知","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/innate-knowledge/extending-liangzhi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-final-teaching","title":"圣门的正法眼藏","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/core-contributions/innate-knowledge/the-final-teaching"}]}]}